			<item>
				<title>Take the Long Way Home</title>
				<link>/take-long-way-home/</link>
				<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2020 23:59:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/take-long-way-home/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;(Written while listening to &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7btmeE8Ewa8&#34;&gt;Supertramp&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I looked over at my Romeo. How about we make a picture show? Let&amp;rsquo;s take the long way home. A corona-free drive home.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We&amp;rsquo;ll have some times when we feel we&amp;rsquo;re part of the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.nps.gov/zion/planyourvisit/kolob-canyons.htm&#34;&gt;scenery&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Drive out to the Farm</title>
				<link>/drive-to-farm/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2020 03:57:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/drive-to-farm/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://biology.ucdavis.edu/people/jeff-schank&#34;&gt;Jeff&lt;/a&gt; and I decided to take a drive out to the farm.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiVjfUcqOyN-Ik9_TlXO1XQaQav7ESb-iFmUHPpHeKNkc4JapnZtJ5pUqrMo-9rNhbcVeUFGGRp3IrBpl-jGQN-qDVw6ClCPC8-SFjPXLGdCLsOivbbHu4yD8qv_vcHxCjygKOC7LOD6_qd/s640/IMG_5919.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;IMG_5919.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Along the way, we saw some beautiful red rocks.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi03dGosWIIizhCwrVPXWMDYNDX5mqp_ANc1iwUe-b_qAWPvrG4rKbQ8x5YkMxXdl6xeT5bJwvvxFe1L_xfUz07eegtHMs2D1agALwiqJn_qeMs-nh_Ls6S303JFtpXmGdu-9tHv4VAqxV8/s640/IMG_5990.JPG&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;IMG_5990.JPG&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;And a pretty college campus.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhtr76f-8h33GC0jlf_FTqSXK3OyHD234mwDsOb0s8wCIK7gumiDENTzMOwg8Z-NI9Gs6OvFW-qN55SEK0HvNsydbS8609sYRqkCn4SYCjEWfF_ZJ3STg-auufmnCS9V4XYYL5G3B3uyeTk/s640/IMG_6063.JPG&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;IMG_6063.JPG&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;And about 55 hours later, we stopped to pick up Dad.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>The bridge to totality (eclipse)</title>
				<link>/the-bridge-to-totality-eclipse-2017/</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 22 Aug 2017 06:03:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>/the-bridge-to-totality-eclipse-2017/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Woo hooo, the August 21, 2017 total eclipse went right through our town. We walked from Dad&amp;rsquo;s house to the Platte River bridge on Dark Island Trail to experience totality. OMG IT WAS AMAZING.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
